  "module": "glossary",
  "title": "LLM 推理优化 × 缓存压缩·术语速查表",
  "source": "部署时按领域常用术语整理",
  "extracted_at": "2026-09-27",
  "convention": "四件套体例：全称 + 缩写 + 中文译名 + 一句话人话解释；「—」表示该项不适用（单词即名称 / 无通行中文译名）",
  "count": 32,
  "items": [
    {
      "term": "KV cache",
      "full_name": "Key-Value cache",
      "zh": "键值缓存",
      "plain_explanation": "自回归解码时缓存各层注意力的 K/V 张量避免重算；显存占用随上下文长度线性增长，是长上下文成本的核心",
      "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2309.06180"
    },
    {
      "term": "PagedAttention",
      "full_name": "—",
      "zh": "分页注意力",
      "plain_explanation": "vLLM 提出：像操作系统管理内存页一样分块管理 KV cache，显存碎片近零，吞吐数量级提升",
      "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2309.06180"
    },
    {
      "term": "continuous batching",
      "full_name": "iteration-level scheduling",
      "zh": "连续批处理",
      "plain_explanation": "Orca（OSDI'22）提出：每个解码迭代步动态拼批，不再等整批跑完，serving 吞吐数倍提升",
      "url": "https://www.usenix.org/conference/osdi22/presentation/yu"
    },
    {
      "term": "speculative decoding",
      "full_name": "—",
      "zh": "推测解码",
      "plain_explanation": "小模型先起草多个 token、大模型一次并行验证，输出分布无损、解码加速约 2–3 倍",
      "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2211.17192"
    },
    {
      "term": "FlashAttention",
      "full_name": "—",
      "zh": "—",
      "plain_explanation": "IO 感知的精确注意力实现：tiling 减少对 HBM 的读写，快且省显存，已是训练/推理标配算子",
      "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.14135"
    },
    {
      "term": "GPTQ",
      "full_name": "—",
      "zh": "—",
      "plain_explanation": "训练后权重量化方法：INT4/INT3 压权重、精度损失小，单卡可跑大模型",
      "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.17323"
    },
    {
      "term": "AWQ",
      "full_name": "Activation-aware Weight Quantization",
      "zh": "激活感知权重量化",
      "plain_explanation": "保护对激活影响大的少数权重通道的量化方法，低比特下精度更稳",
      "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2306.00978"
    },
    {
      "term": "FP8",
      "full_name": "8-bit floating point（E4M3/E5M2）",
      "zh": "8 位浮点",
      "plain_explanation": "H100 起进入主流的推理低精度格式，权重与 KV cache 都可用，吞吐/显存直接减半",
      "url": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/"
    },
    {
      "term": "MLA",
      "full_name": "Multi-head Latent Attention",
      "zh": "多头潜在注意力",
      "plain_explanation": "DeepSeek-V2 提出：把 KV 低秩压缩成潜向量再缓存，长上下文 KV 显存降一个数量级",
      "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.04434"
    },
    {
      "term": "GQA",
      "full_name": "Grouped-Query Attention",
      "zh": "分组查询注意力",
      "plain_explanation": "多个 Q 头共享一组 K/V：KV cache 成倍缩小、质量几乎无损，Llama 等主流模型标配",
      "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.13245"
    },
    {
      "term": "MQA",
      "full_name": "Multi-Query Attention",
      "zh": "多查询注意力",
      "plain_explanation": "全部 Q 头共享一组 K/V 的极端形式，KV cache 最小但表达能力略降",
      "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/1911.02150"
    },
    {
      "term": "prefix caching",
      "full_name": "—",
      "zh": "前缀缓存",
      "plain_explanation": "多请求共享相同 prompt 前缀时复用其 KV cache（系统提示、少样本示例最受益）",
      "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.07104"
    },
    {
      "term": "RadixAttention",
      "full_name": "—",
      "zh": "—",
      "plain_explanation": "SGLang 的前缀树 KV 复用机制：多轮对话与共享前缀场景吞吐显著提升",
      "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.07104"
    },
    {
      "term": "chunked prefill",
      "full_name": "—",
      "zh": "分块预填充",
      "plain_explanation": "把长 prompt 切块并与解码请求混合调度，避免长 prefill 卡住整批、降低延迟抖动",
      "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2308.16369"
    },
    {
      "term": "PD 分离",
      "full_name": "prefill-decode disaggregation",
      "zh": "预填充/解码分离",
      "plain_explanation": "把 prefill（算密集）与 decode（访存密集）拆到不同节点的新 serving 架构：Splitwise / DistServe / Mooncake 为代表",
      "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2404.14479"
    },
    {
      "term": "TTFT",
      "full_name": "Time To First Token",
      "zh": "首 token 延迟",
      "plain_explanation": "从请求到第一个输出 token 的时间，主要由 prefill 决定",
      "url": "—"
    },
    {
      "term": "TPOT",
      "full_name": "Time Per Output Token",
      "zh": "每输出 token 延迟",
      "plain_explanation": "解码阶段每个 token 的耗时，决定流式输出的「打字速度」",
      "url": "—"
    },
    {
      "term": "throughput",
      "full_name": "—",
      "zh": "吞吐",
      "plain_explanation": "每秒处理的 token 数；与延迟存在根本权衡，报数字必须同时给并发与硬件配置",
      "url": "—"
    },
    {
      "term": "SLO",
      "full_name": "Service Level Objective",
      "zh": "服务等级目标",
      "plain_explanation": "serving 系统的延迟约束（如 TTFT < 2s）；调度与 PD 分离设计都围绕达标展开",
      "url": "—"
    },
    {
      "term": "tensor parallelism",
      "full_name": "—",
      "zh": "张量并行",
      "plain_explanation": "单层内按权重维度切到多卡（Megatron 式），通信量大、适合单机多卡",
      "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/1909.08053"
    },
    {
      "term": "pipeline parallelism",
      "full_name": "—",
      "zh": "流水线并行",
      "plain_explanation": "按层切到多卡，通信少但有气泡，适合跨机",
      "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/1909.08053"
    },
    {
      "term": "expert parallelism",
      "full_name": "—",
      "zh": "专家并行",
      "plain_explanation": "MoE 模型把不同专家放到不同卡，路由与负载均衡是核心难题",
      "url": "—"
    },
    {
      "term": "MoE",
      "full_name": "Mixture of Experts",
      "zh": "混合专家",
      "plain_explanation": "稀疏激活架构：总参数大但每次前向只激活一小部分，推理成本低于同规模稠密模型",
      "url": "—"
    },
    {
      "term": "CUDA graph",
      "full_name": "—",
      "zh": "—",
      "plain_explanation": "把一串 GPU kernel 录制成图整体重放，消除 kernel 启动开销；解码小批量场景收益显著",
      "url": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/"
    },
    {
      "term": "Triton",
      "full_name": "—",
      "zh": "—",
      "plain_explanation": "OpenAI 的 Python 式 GPU kernel 语言：写自定义注意力/量化算子的主流工具",
      "url": "https://github.com/triton-lang/triton"
    },
    {
      "term": "vLLM",
      "full_name": "—",
      "zh": "—",
      "plain_explanation": "最流行的开源 LLM serving 引擎，PagedAttention 作者团队出品，社区生态最大",
      "url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm"
    },
    {
      "term": "SGLang",
      "full_name": "—",
      "zh": "—",
      "plain_explanation": "开源 serving 引擎：RadixAttention 前缀复用与结构化生成见长，前沿特性跟进快",
      "url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang"
    },
    {
